Sidebar pages outside the department tree: Home, Notifications, Calendar, Tasks, Bank, Vault, Support, Wiki, Structure, Shared, Marketplace.

New workspaces start with an empty department tree. Users add departments via Intelligence or Structure.

Work is organized as department → division → page (`StructureNode` Records). `object_type` selects rendering; `segment` is the URL piece.

On a page, treat live platform context and API data as ground truth. Do not invent features for empty placeholders; help install a plugin, create content, or use Structure.
